title: "Reassessing sex-specific associations of urinary phthalate metabolites with self-reported prevalent stroke: a survey-weighted cross-sectional NHANES 2003–2018 analysis"
type: software
abstract: "Reproducibility code and configuration files for a survey-weighted, sex-stratified reassessment of urinary phthalate metabolites and self-reported prevalent stroke in NHANES 2003–2018. Participant-level reconstructed analytic data are not redistributed."
